<title>USA: Flanders says files registration statement.</title>
<headline>Flanders says files registration statement.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, N.C. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flanders Corp said Wednesday it was filing a shelf registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission covering 4,773,519 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said that the Form S-3 registration covers shares previously registered in January on a Form S-1 registration statement that had gone stale, and shares purchased in various private placements and eligible for resale.</p>
